<ArticleLayout
  title="Air Conditioner Dry Mode & Humidity: What It Does and When to Use It"
  seoTitle="Air Conditioner Dry Mode & Humidity | Australian Guide"
  description="Learn what air-conditioner dry mode does, when it suits humid Australian weather, how it differs from cooling and when a dehumidifier may help."
  category="Living Spaces"
